{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10420","headline":"鲁郡途中遇徐十八录事 · 高适","name":"鲁郡途中遇徐十八录事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁谓嵩颍客，遂经邹鲁乡。\n前临少昊墟，始觉东蒙长。\n独行岂吾心，怀古激中肠。\n圣人久已矣，游夏遥相望。\n裴回野泽间，左右多悲伤。\n日出见阙里，川平知汶阳。\n弱冠负高节，十年思自强。\n终然不得意，去去任行藏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10420.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10420","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}